cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Color Classification with KNN: Bilingual Persian/English"
abstract: >-
  A two-stage hierarchical K-nearest-neighbors system that predicts bilingual
  Persian/English color names from RGB hex codes. Stage 1 predicts a coarse
  color family; Stage 2 retrieves the closest exact shade in CIE L*a*b* space.
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-06"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/kopolart/knn-color-classification"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kopolart/knn-color-classification"
keywords:
  - KNN
  - k-nearest-neighbors
  - color classification
  - color naming
  - Persian
  - scikit-learn
  - machine learning
